1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:07,421
A very common slip in exams: writing that Laplace's correction is needed because sound is longitudinal.

2
00:00:07,421 --> 00:00:09,231
That has nothing to do with it.

3
00:00:09,231 --> 00:00:19,453
The only change is that the compressions are adiabatic, so the bulk modulus is gamma P, not P. Say that sentence, and the mark is yours.

